<title>USA: Sacramento, Calif., utility district deal repriced.</title>
<headline>Sacramento, Calif., utility district deal repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. said Wednesday it repriced Sacramento Municipal Utility District, Calif.'s $131 million bond deal, raising the top yield in 2024 to 5.42 percent from 5.40 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>SACRAMENTO MUNICIPAL UTILITY DISTRICT</p>
<p>RE: $131,030,000*</p>
<p>ELECTRIC REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1997 SERIES K</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD BASED ON THE FOLLOWING.</p>
<p>NO NEW ORDERS.</p>
<p>FORMAL AWARD EXPECTED TOMORROW MORNING.</p>
<p> MOODY'S: Aaa EXP	   S&amp;P: AAA EXP	    FITCH: AAA EXP</p>
<p>	    UNDER: A3 CONF	 UNDER: A CONF    UNDER: A CONF</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p> DATED: 06/15/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>07/01/2017    13,405M	     5.70  %	  5.30</p>
<p>07/01/2018    14,170M	     5.75  %	  5.33</p>
<p>07/01/2019    14,985M	     5.80  %	  5.35</p>
<p>07/01/2020    15,850M	     5.90  %	  5.35</p>
<p>07/01/2024    72,620M	     5.25  %	  5.42</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 97.603)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, June 19, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on July 2, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
